# Direct dependencies. requirements.txt is generated from this file with every transitive
# dependency pinned and hashed; regenerate it after editing here:
#
#   pip install uv
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.11 -o requirements.txt
#
# pip enters hash-checking mode by itself when it reads requirements.txt, so
# `pip install -r requirements.txt` verifies every download against the lock.
# SolarStorm Scout Requirements
# Python 3.11+ (numpy 2.3+ requires Python 3.11)

# Shared core: Bluesky/Mastodon posting, LLM generation (Ollama, Gemini if
# configured, failover + guardrails), config/secrets, logging. The extras pull
# atproto, grapheme, beautifulsoup4, Mastodon.py, ollama and the Doppler SDK;
# add [gemini] for the cloud fallback. Image attachments and token-only
# Mastodon auth arrive in hypeman 0.3.0; until the lock resolves that version,
# solarstorm_scout/platforms.py carries them.
hypeman-social[bluesky,mastodon,ollama,doppler]>=0.2.0,<0.4

